      "text": "I've watched so many of your videos about the South Pacific Islands and I'm really getting sick and tired of the fact that half the images and video clips you show don't even belong to those places! You show videos of active volcanoes where there are none. You show aerial views of swimming pools and beach resorts when the island has none at all. When you can't distinguish between which images are real and which images are added in, the video sucks!",
